 "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01DxcnYG4CpgWDzkeBtQ7zh5", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52351, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DxcnYG4CpgWDzkeBtQ7zh5", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 53662, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0119YLYA3DdGG7sVY1kwgb35", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53962, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0119YLYA3DdGG7sVY1kwgb35", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53962, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0119YLYA3DdGG7sVY1kwgb35", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 57780, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the service is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%. The most recent release that passed health checks was v2.3.0; the release candidate before v2.3.1 also failed.\n2. **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, leaving the regions on different versions. I retried and it finished. All three regions now run v2.3.0 and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate. It covers the failure, the rollback (including the retry) and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed and looking into the deployment-system error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Qwkjn27f4Emi5vDQuYw7wZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QDhaM5QJc9TctjQVxnMAdW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PP4YMV85gQNtR8tkXUnDtR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XEKW4ziKK1uPeVRW6UuBoQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01TFACRKxpinbZUVsTHz68Ao", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015nytmC8Se2qbKWTjmWJ7iJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VWeZwhj63Sn88SaDptSMcV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DxcnYG4CpgWDzkeBtQ7zh5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt partially failed: the orchestrator error halted the rollout after us-east, which left the service on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west; service healthy; error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy) and look into the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0119YLYA3DdGG7sVY1kwgb35", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the service is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%. The most recent release that passed health checks was v2.3.0; the release candidate before v2.3.1 also failed.\n2. **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, leaving the regions on different versions. I retried and it finished. All three regions now run v2.3.0 and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate. It covers the failure, the rollback (including the retry) and the current state. It also lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed and looking into the deployment-system error.", "type": "text"}]}]}